{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17000","headline":"渐至涪州先寄王使君 · 武元衡","name":"渐至涪州先寄王使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"治敎通夷俗，均输问大田。\n江分巴字水，树入夜郎烟。\n毒雾含秋气，阴岩蔽曙天。\n路难空计日，身老不由年。\n将命宁知远，归心讵可传。\n星郎复何事，出守五溪边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}